				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-4658163#post-3669332</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-4658163/lego-minithinkers-8y9d5-2x4h7-s89m2#post-3669332</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 29 Dec 2017 19:39:51 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Baronjoe</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3376201</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>No, they are selling a Dr Wondertainment toy that look like Lego figures. Also to answer your question that you also posted, MC&amp;D are receiving a complaint that the item does disturbing behavior. MC&amp;D alter the product description made by Dr Wondertainment to falsely state that the toys behave on the bases of what the kids want to do. Basically, blaming the kids for the disturbing behavior. Then, they also attached a thing from Prometheus Labs to &quot;certify&quot; that it's just the kids for the toy can &quot;detect&quot; something wrong with the kids. This is false and just a thing to reduce complaints and blame the kids even though the toys are the problem.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
